 *
 * 1. Create a member using the provided API (discussionboard.members.create).
 * 2. Create a profile for that member (discussionboard.memberProfiles.create).
 * 3. Issue a DELETE request to erase the created profile (discussionboard.memberProfiles.erase).
 * 4. Attempt to retrieve (read) the profile by its ID (using discussionboard.memberProfiles.at or equivalent – not available: skip fetch, only assert no recovery via type or further call if possible).
 * 5. Confirm that the operation fails as expected (either error thrown or not found result).
