 *   2. Create a data erasure request for the member.
 *   3. Delete the data erasure request by id using the authorized account.
 *   4. Attempt to re-fetch the deleted data erasure request, expect error.
 *   5. Check that member record still exists.
 *   6. Try to delete as an unauthorized member (expect error).
