 * 3. Assert that all atomic fields (name, code, organization, flags) match what was submitted, and generated fields (id, timestamps) are proper and consistent.
 * 4. Schema validation on the returned object.
 * 5. Optionally, test with/without optional description to confirm null and string values are accepted.
 */
export async function test_api_discussionboard_boards_at(
